  "prefLabel": "Ec-Wtr 203.19 Request to Confirm Consistency with Council Order",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ec-Wtr 203.19 Request to Confirm Consistency with Council Order.\n\n(a) A request by a party pursuant to RSA 21-O:14, I-a(d) to confirm that a revised decision by the commissioner is consistent with the council’s remand order shall:\n\n(1) Be in writing and conform to the filing requirements of Ec-Wtr 203.04; and\n\n(2) Include a copy of the revised decision.\n\n(b) Upon receipt of a request under paragraph (a) above, the presiding officer shall, within 30 days:\n\n(1) Rule on the request, if the presiding officer determines that doing so does not require consultation with the council; or\n\n(2) Refer the request to the council for resolution at its next scheduled meeting.\n\n(c) A request under paragraph (a) above shall not entitle the requester to a hearing.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Ec-Wtr 200) #13923, eff 4-11-24\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRULE | STATUTE\n\nEc-Wtr 201 | RSA 21-O:7; RSA 21-O:14; RSA 541-A:16, I(b)(3); RSA 541-A:16, I(c); RSA 541-A:4; RSA 541-A:11\n\nEc-Wtr 202 | RSA 21-O:7, V, RSA 541-A:16, I(c)-(d)\n\nEc-Wtr 203 | RSA 21-O:7; RSA 21-O:14; RSA 541-A:16, I(b)(2); RSA 541-A:30-a",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ec-wtr200.html"
